<title>JAPAN: Bunkyodo to issue $35 mln in FRN.</title>
<headline>Bunkyodo to issue $35 mln in FRN.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Bunkyodo Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Bank of Yokohama Europe S.A.</p>
<p> GUARANTOR - Bank of Yokohama Ltd</p>
<p> FISCAL AGENT - Bank of Yokohama Ltd's London branch</p>
<p> TYPE    FRN	    ISSUE NO		AMT   $35 million</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE  par	MATURITY 29.May.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE  29.May.97 INT PAY  29.May/Nov</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 20.May.97 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>NOTE - Coupon on the floating rate note (FRN) will be set at 0.25 percentage point above the six-month Eurodollar London Interbank Offered Rate (LIBOR).</p>
</text>
